content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "Person or household requesting pest control services.",
      "attributes": [
        "Property"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Property",
      "description": "The location where inspection or treatment takes place."
    },
    {
      "name": "Infestation Report",
      "description": "A report filed by a customer describing signs of pests or infestation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Home Inspection",
      "description": "A scheduled visit where a technician inspects the property and applies treatments.",
      "attributes": [
        "Customer",
        "Inspection Report",
        "Treatment",
        "Equipment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Inspection Report",
      "description": "Detailed findings recorded by the technician during an inspection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Treatment",
      "description": "Pesticide or control method used to address a specific infestation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipment",
      "description": "Tools or devices used by technicians during inspections or treatments."
    },
    {
      "name": "Treatment Plan",
      "description": "Document outlining recommended pest control steps provided to the customer."
    },
    {
      "name": "Technician",
      "description": "Field worker performing inspections and applying pest control treatments."
    },
    {
      "name": "Manager",
      "description": "Person overseeing operations, scheduling, and supply management."
    },
    {
      "name": "Service Records",
      "description": "Collection of records tracking completed inspections and reports.",
      "attributes": [
        "Inspection Report"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Inventory",
      "description": "Current stock of pest control equipment and materials.",
      "attributes": [
        "Equipment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Supply Order",
      "description": "Request placed by the manager to restock pest control supplies.",
      "attributes": [
        "Equipment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Supplier",
      "description": "External provider delivering pest control equipment and materials."
    },
    {
      "name": "Supply Delivery",
      "description": "Confirmed shipment of ordered supplies from supplier to the company.",
      "attributes": [
        "Equipment"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name the two related objects and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Customer",
      "to": "Infestation Report",
      "description": "Customer reports an infestation to initiate service."
    },
    {
      "from": "Manager",
      "to": "Infestation Report",
      "description": "Manager receives and reviews reported infestations."
    },
    {
      "from": "Manager",
      "to": "Home Inspection",
      "description": "Manager schedules and assigns technicians to inspections."
    },
    {
      "from": "Manager",
      "to": "Technician",
      "description": "Manager manages technician assignments and workload."
    },
    {
      "from": "Technician",
      "to": "Treatment Plan",
      "description": "Technician creates and provides treatment plans after inspections."
    },
    {
      "from": "Treatment Plan",
      "to": "Customer",
      "description": "Customer receives the technician’s recommended treatment plan."
    },
    {
      "from": "Technician",
      "to": "Inventory",
      "description": "Technician uses and tracks equipment from inventory."
    },
    {
      "from": "Manager",
      "to": "Service Records",
      "description": "Manager updates service records after each inspection."
    },
    {
      "from": "Manager",
      "to": "Inventory",
      "description": "Manager monitors available inventory for operations."
    },
    {
      "from": "Manager",
      "to": "Supply Order",
      "description": "Manager places supply orders to restock inventory."
    },
    {
      "from": "Supply Order",
      "to": "Supplier",
      "description": "Supply order is sent to the supplier for fulfillment."
    },
    {
      "from": "Supplier",
      "to": "Supply Delivery",
      "description": "Supplier sends ordered equipment and materials."
    },
    {
      "from": "Supply Delivery",
      "to": "Manager",
      "description": "Manager receives and confirms delivery of supplies."
    }
  ]
}
```
